  message: "Status check 2026-10-20: still open on dev 2760e4010b. No def/use extractor handles tree-sitter named_expression (grep over packages/*/src finds none), so a walrus target is still a use only. Unmerged work exists: worktree ~/hg_wt/tozar, local branch jgstern-agent/fix/tozar, own commit f2171d3b86 (python named_expression + JS/TS nested assignment_expression define their target), last targeted run 481 passed with coverage OK; corpus A/B was in progress in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/tozar/, no report. The branch sits on the pre-rebase stage-8b base c1dd831558: integrate by cherry-picking f2171d3b86 onto origin/dev only (git cherry shows it is not on dev). Expect overlap with WI-losod's *_def_use.py edits, which are on dev."  # 9bb3
